# Everything.Rent — Local environment template
# ==============================================
# You do NOT need to copy this file anywhere for normal local dev.
#
# Non-secret dev values are committed to `.env.development` (auto-loaded by
# varlock when APP_ENV=development). Secrets come from Bitwarden Secrets
# Manager — see docs/bitwarden-secrets-setup.md for the full setup.
#
# The only piece you still have to set yourself is `BWS_SECRETS_TOKEN`, and it
# MUST live in your OS/shell env — never in a file in this repo:
#
# Windows (PowerShell, persist for your user profile):
#   [Environment]::SetEnvironmentVariable("BWS_SECRETS_TOKEN", "<token>", "User")
#
# macOS / Linux:
#   echo 'export BWS_SECRETS_TOKEN="<token>"' >> ~/.zshrc && source ~/.zshrc
#
# Optional: override individual values on your machine by creating `.env.local`
# (gitignored). It wins over `.env.development` and is useful for one-off
# experiments. Don't put real secrets there — use BWS.
